From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] iam: use function map capacity for permission replies

Match the registered map capacity without changing permission semantics.
Exercise 17 and 32 keys of 256 characters through the real server.

Upstream-Status: Pending [native regression proof; mainline migration]
Base: aos_core_cpp 9d613a46df3c7f550062e2f19ae3406c57715694

